    "buy and sell are named from the NPC's point of view, facing a customer on the right.",
    "Trade events are visual cues for a trade the game has already agreed; the game keeps the stock, prices and payments.",
    "The heal row shows the NPC receiving healing, not casting it.",
    "hide ends in a visible crouch; cover must come from the level. There is no stand-up or crouch-walk row.",
    "F6 of hit, heal, buy, sell and wave equals idle F1; teleport_in F6 equals idle F1.",
    "The walking stick is part of every frame; in death it lies beside the body.",
    "Buying shows dried herbs and a coin; selling shows a woven charm and a coin. They are drawn into the frames, not separate items."
